{"posts":[{"id":"alex_p13_301","t":"Kovalenko wrote: I found nice Foto in the internet. Gold rule: work and relax must be 50\\50\n\nHave a nice weekend!\n\nlol","a":"juniormaiafx","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#301","p":13,"im":["59e93b524393964faa3ff2a67eb399a112b1ee5f"],"fa":"Kovalenko نوشت: یک عکس قشنگ در اینترنت پیدا کردم. قانون طلایی: کار و استراحت باید 50\\50 باشد\n\nآخر هفتهٔ خوبی داشته باشید!\n\nهاها","ib":{"59e93b524393964faa3ff2a67eb399a112b1ee5f":2},"m":301},{"id":"alex_p13_302","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#302","p":13,"im":["ac501fe7b98031daddf614ac7c6e254af161e6b5"],"ib":{"ac501fe7b98031daddf614ac7c6e254af161e6b5":0},"m":302},{"id":"alex_p13_303","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#303","p":13,"im":["df6cadc0b0e68b57a07c24832b5935f0ade0e609"],"ib":{"df6cadc0b0e68b57a07c24832b5935f0ade0e609":0},"m":303},{"id":"alex_p13_304","t":"Hello Kovalenko. I have one very confusing thing. How do you confirm to enter when price engulf and back to ftr zone please help me?","a":"smile","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#304","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"سلام Kovalenko. یک چیز خیلی گیج‌کننده دارم. وقتی قیمت اینگالف می‌کند و به ناحیهٔ FTR برمی‌گردد، چطور ورود را تأیید می‌کنی؟ لطفاً کمکم کن؟","m":304},{"id":"alex_p13_305","t":"smile wrote: Hello Kovalenko. I have one very confusing thing. How do you confirm to enter when price engulf and back to ftr zone please help me?\n\nHi smile, Price engulfed FTR ( 2 times). Please note, when price came back - there was no HH, only LH\n\nAlso -the Last GAP, please note, after it, I marked red S/R, price engulfed this level. Then price retested CAP and went down.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#305","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"smile نوشت: سلام Kovalenko. یک چیز خیلی گیج‌کننده دارم. وقتی قیمت اینگالف می‌کند و به ناحیهٔ FTR برمی‌گردد، چطور ورود را تأیید می‌کنی؟ لطفاً کمکم کن؟\n\nسلام smile، قیمت FTR را اینگالف کرد (2 بار). توجه کن، وقتی قیمت برگشت، HH نداشت، فقط LH بود\n\nهمچنین — آخرین GAP، دقت کن، بعد از آن S/R قرمز را علامت زدم، قیمت این سطح را اینگالف کرد. بعد قیمت CAP را ریتست کرد و پایین رفت.","m":305},{"id":"alex_p13_306","t":"Sorry no charts, I am in a business trip now.\n\nGood luck to all. I wish everybody to\n\nhave a lot of profits.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#306","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"ببخشید چارتی نیست، الان در سفر کاری هستم.\n\nموفق باشید همه. آرزو می‌کنم همه‌تان\n\nسودهای زیاد ببرید.","m":306},{"id":"alex_p13_307","t":"I miss your posts alex!! Have fun on your business trip! Any live swing trade?","a":"projectsagana","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#307","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"دلم برای پست‌هایت تنگ شده alex!! در سفر کاری‌ات خوش بگذرد! معاملهٔ سوئینگ لایو نداری؟","m":307},{"id":"alex_p13_308","t":"Find strong down\\up movement. Find only key ENG, key FTR, key FLAG. No need to trade every ENG, every FTR. Step by step price shows us what we should do. Follow the market.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#308","p":13,"im":["a2de0a313cef4b47ecc7ff97a9badfb579013f91"],"fa":"حرکت قوی نزولی/صعودی را پیدا کن. فقط اینگالف کلیدی، FTR کلیدی و FLAG کلیدی را در نظر بگیر. لازم نیست هر اینگالف و هر FTR را معامله کنی. قدم‌به‌قدم قیمت نشانمان می‌دهد چه باید بکنیم. بازار را دنبال کن.","ib":{"a2de0a313cef4b47ecc7ff97a9badfb579013f91":1},"m":308},{"id":"alex_p13_309","t":"Alex, you are my savior lol That's my analysis, the CPAZ and FO Zone are correct?","a":"juniormaiafx","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#309","p":13,"im":["9fa4715a0b191be6cc74a2f2e7d95b890df9b8ba"],"fa":"Alex، تو نجات‌دهندهٔ منی هاها این تحلیل من است، CPAZ و ناحیهٔ FO درست هستند؟","ib":{"9fa4715a0b191be6cc74a2f2e7d95b890df9b8ba":1},"m":309},{"id":"alex_p13_310","t":"Hi alex, How do you define strong move? Ok this I understand the larger the candle body the stronger the move. It could be subjective to each person. But how do you define key eng, key ftr and key flag? Could you show me the different between key eng,ftr,flag and non important eng,ftr,flag. Thanks.","a":"gristar","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#310","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"سلام alex، حرکت قوی را چطور تعریف می‌کنی؟ خب این را می‌فهمم که هر چه بدنهٔ کندل بزرگ‌تر باشد حرکت قوی‌تر است. این می‌تواند برای هر کس سلیقه‌ای باشد. اما اینگالف کلیدی، FTR کلیدی و فلگ کلیدی را چطور تعریف می‌کنی؟ می‌توانی تفاوت اینگالف، FTR و فلگ کلیدی را با اینگالف، FTR و فلگ غیرمهم نشانم بدهی؟ ممنون.","m":310},{"id":"alex_p13_311","t":"Hi juniormaiafx","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#311","p":13,"im":["ae8a14a64d0b1a19acd1251155d5cbb553af54d3"],"fa":"سلام juniormaiafx","ib":{"ae8a14a64d0b1a19acd1251155d5cbb553af54d3":1},"m":311},{"id":"alex_p13_312","t":"Kovalenko wrote: Hi juniormaiafx\n\nHey Brother... thank you very much!!!","a":"juniormaiafx","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#312","p":13,"im":["ae8a14a64d0b1a19acd1251155d5cbb553af54d3"],"fa":"Kovalenko نوشت: سلام juniormaiafx\n\nسلام برادر… خیلی ممنون!!!","ib":{"ae8a14a64d0b1a19acd1251155d5cbb553af54d3":1},"m":312},{"id":"alex_p13_313","t":"Hi Gristar Find obvious Swings. For example, here below, then creating FTR, Eng, and so on.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#313","p":13,"im":["83f7cb719fa6587e84d555f8d4620bba43e3cc7c","e3ce3e5923cf845c91f0606a0bc77560f8eb2fe3"],"fa":"سلام Gristar. سوئینگ‌های واضح را پیدا کن. مثلاً همین پایین، بعد ساختن FTR، اینگالف و به همین ترتیب.","ib":{"83f7cb719fa6587e84d555f8d4620bba43e3cc7c":1,"e3ce3e5923cf845c91f0606a0bc77560f8eb2fe3":1},"m":313},{"id":"alex_p13_314","t":"Thanks a lot. Nice explanation here Alex.","a":"Man","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#314","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"خیلی ممنون. توضیح قشنگی بود Alex.","m":314},{"id":"alex_p13_315","t":"trades","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#315","p":13,"im":["e484ef1f4346eb7fdde10fdf7c3e1da340344df0","9cace3ebb64cbe6bf9fcfbd34164cb914b485c6b"],"fa":"معاملات","ib":{"e484ef1f4346eb7fdde10fdf7c3e1da340344df0":1,"9cace3ebb64cbe6bf9fcfbd34164cb914b485c6b":1},"m":315},{"id":"alex_p13_316","t":"Nice one, seems like a few people were on this. I had same trade, same target, was going for the tight stop for good RR, didn't notice the QM level, pipped out. Rookie error!","a":"smimon","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#316","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"قشنگ بود، به نظر می‌رسد چند نفر روی این بودند. من هم همین معامله و همین تارگت را داشتم، برای RR خوب دنبال استاپ تنگ بودم، سطح QM را ندیدم و با چند پیپ زود از معامله خارج شدم. اشتباه تازه‌کارها!","m":316},{"id":"alex_p13_317","t":"Hi Alex! Nice trade on GBPUSD! I have 2 questions according to it: 1) Was your target the bottom blue rectangle on your chart or the target was (is) somewhere else? 2) Is there any HTF confirmation about your trade? (for example engulfing of the FL at 1.59377 few days ago)?:)\n\nThank you!","a":"kkb","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#317","p":13,"im":[],"fa":"سلام Alex! معاملهٔ قشنگی روی GBPUSD! دو سؤال درباره‌اش دارم: 1) تارگتت مستطیل آبی پایین چارتت بود یا تارگت جای دیگری بود (هست)؟ 2) آیا تأیید HTF‌ای دربارهٔ معامله‌ات هست؟ (مثلاً اینگالف FL در 1.59377 چند روز پیش)؟ :)\n\nممنون!","m":317},{"id":"alex_p13_318","t":"kkb wrote: Hi Alex! Nice trade on GBPUSD! I have 2 questions according to it: 1) Was your target the bottom blue rectangle on your chart or the target was (is) somewhere else? 2) Is there any HTF confirmation about your trade? (for example engulfing of the FL at 1.59377 few days ago)?:)\n\nThank you!\n\nHi\n\nI marked -1. Tg 2. it was FTR - FTB I closed a deal early (technical mistake)","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#318","p":13,"im":["da0970f7c0503c5bbe58a40c5c107df4f014f05f"],"fa":"kkb نوشت: سلام Alex! معاملهٔ قشنگی روی GBPUSD! دو سؤال درباره‌اش دارم: 1) تارگتت مستطیل آبی پایین چارتت بود یا تارگت جای دیگری بود (هست)؟ 2) آیا تأیید HTF‌ای دربارهٔ معامله‌ات هست؟ (مثلاً اینگالف FL در 1.59377 چند روز پیش)؟ :)\n\nممنون!\n\nسلام\n\nعلامت زدم — 1. Tg 2. FTR بود — FTB؛ معامله را زود بستم (اشتباه تکنیکال)","ib":{"da0970f7c0503c5bbe58a40c5c107df4f014f05f":3},"m":318},{"id":"alex_p13_319","t":"2trades today","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#319","p":13,"im":["7f7a4cc74d35a3c5093da51cbda99d03c3f7b09b"],"fa":"2trades 2 معامله امروز","ib":{"7f7a4cc74d35a3c5093da51cbda99d03c3f7b09b":1},"m":319},{"id":"alex_p13_320","t":"trade","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#320","p":13,"im":["474167f4ed3adc3e877398ec88ee7b98eb4c4abc"],"fa":"معامله","ib":{"474167f4ed3adc3e877398ec88ee7b98eb4c4abc":0},"m":320},{"id":"alex_p13_321","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#321","p":13,"im":["78bd182700aa7c003b6d6810f5ddc3d89297876d","a950fc264b9cdbae0b7c93ae939b69cf21f73d3f","18a5e9f18ad208bbedc9a50c14b1958c06d6fea7","18b4c947df8a6880e235e244dc1fddefa1b18026"],"ib":{"78bd182700aa7c003b6d6810f5ddc3d89297876d":0,"a950fc264b9cdbae0b7c93ae939b69cf21f73d3f":0,"18a5e9f18ad208bbedc9a50c14b1958c06d6fea7":0,"18b4c947df8a6880e235e244dc1fddefa1b18026":0},"m":321},{"id":"alex_p13_322","t":"Great to see you posting again Alex! I always learn so much. Cheers.","a":"antraxia","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#322","p":13,"im":["f8c859f7e2ea370beb8a020385d8046e9a585e11"],"fa":"خوشحالم که دوباره پست می‌گذاری Alex! همیشه کلی یاد می‌گیرم. دمت گرم.","ib":{"f8c859f7e2ea370beb8a020385d8046e9a585e11":0},"m":322},{"id":"alex_p13_323","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#323","p":13,"im":["8e30a3f02be876ef2f5d6d0be3e33e2f7eacbc7e","e28ca01d16bd8f099f2e2e95d8c45d3a2bc84177","83ab0fe34a0180d6bfd0eb96d751c061214df197","eca2061cb1d92aca68835df2a66fc2e447ff208a","83a15da241333a4d944f906d7035a56216858651"],"ib":{"8e30a3f02be876ef2f5d6d0be3e33e2f7eacbc7e":0,"e28ca01d16bd8f099f2e2e95d8c45d3a2bc84177":0,"83ab0fe34a0180d6bfd0eb96d751c061214df197":0,"eca2061cb1d92aca68835df2a66fc2e447ff208a":0,"83a15da241333a4d944f906d7035a56216858651":0},"m":323},{"id":"alex_p13_324","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","r":"Associate Trader","n":"#324","p":13,"im":["6a03f7892a00d4949c646a391dea77212a55291f","8b324599d0f06813aa1a576972204c46fff19a1f"],"ib":{"6a03f7892a00d4949c646a391dea77212a55291f":